# ═══ Draft knowledge entry — OHOS sysroot 缺 linux/cdrom.h|joystick.h → UNKNOWN_ARCH 分支缺后端符号 ═══
# Timestamp: 2026-10-04
# Software: yabause 0.9.15
# Gate: G2/W3 (tools link)
# Status: UNMATCHED — needs human/AI review to promote to E-entry

id: DRAFT-yabause-ohos-sysroot-missing-linux-hardware-headers
severity: 3
category: platform|sysroot|cmake
trigger_tool: cmake|clang
phase: link
approach: 接受 UNKNOWN_ARCH 分支的 dummy 后端（sock-dummy/thr-dummy）作为交付形态；禁用依赖该头文件的 option（如 YAB_TESTS=OFF）；不手工伪造头文件

keywords: linux/cdrom.h, linux/joystick.h, ArchCD, PERLinuxJoy, UNKNOWN_ARCH, sysroot, OHOS, HarmonyOS

error_signature: undefined symbol: ArchCD|undefined symbol: PERLinuxJoy|undefined reference to .*CDCore|linux/cdrom\.h.*No such file|linux/joystick\.h.*No such file
match_keywords: ArchCD,PERLinuxJoy,cdrom,joystick,UNKNOWN_ARCH,sysroot

root_cause: CMake 检测 CMAKE_SYSTEM_NAME=HarmonyOS 落入项目自定义的 UNKNOWN_ARCH 分支
  （只编译 sock-dummy/thr-dummy，不编译 cd-*.c / perlinuxjoy.c 等硬件后端）；同时 OHOS
  sysroot 缺 <linux/cdrom.h>、<linux/joystick.h>，即使强制走 Linux 分支也无法编译这些
  后端文件。链接依赖这些后端符号的诊断/测试程序（cdtest/pertest）必然失败
affected_scope: 依赖 linux 硬件接口头文件的 CMake 项目在 OHOS 上链接测试/诊断工具
